--- READING ---
The condition is @ConditionalOnProperty on the endpoint key, so leaving the key UNSET
(not empty — removed) backs the whole exporter chain off. The loan sample e2e now runs
with no OTLP exporter at all and its log sweep goes back to being a signal; the demo
supplies the endpoint on the JVM command line and Jaeger is unaffected.
